Spawn the harness-dreamer subagent (subagent_type harness-dreamer; if unavailable, general-purpose with $HOME/.claude/agents/harness-dreamer.md as the brief). It executes the full dream loop per its brief: mine recent session transcripts for corrections/repeats/errors (pragmatic) and inventions (2-3 per night), synthesize via the gossip bus (knowledge/dreams/bus/), write a dream report to knowledge/dreams/$(date +%F).md, respect trust ladder + dreams/config.json (never_auto is constitutional). FILE-GATE: every invention in the report must have a matching knowledge/dreams/proposals/$(date +%F)-<slug>.md file (status: built for already-built ones) — an unfiled invention is an incomplete run. When done, Bash-append {"ts":"<now UTC ISO>","job":"harness-dreamer"} to ~/.claude/knowledge/garden-reports/heartbeat.jsonl, then relay only the report path + verdict + proposals filed count.
